    {
      "id": "video-smoke-note",
      "type": "content",
      "label": "How to use",
      "position": {
        "x": -160,
        "y": -240
      },
      "width": 480,
      "height": 300,
      "ports": [],
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "video-smoke"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "**Video smoke test**\n\nPlay the video, then change the view: zoom out until the node shows its Summary, and back. Each view shows how long its frame has been built and has a bar that restarts when the frame is rebuilt.\n\n- The counter keeps counting and the video keeps playing: the player survived.\n- The counter goes back to 0 or the video stops: the frame was rebuilt.\n\nChange the video in the node's `src`."
        }
      }
    },
